	(text "C21 = Nichicon UES1H470MPM, 47u / 50V bipolar, 10 x 20 mm.\nOnboard in series with filtered tweeter positive -> J17 pin 1.\nJP1 OPEN: capacitor active; JP1 LINKED: bypass for stereo use.\nUse a short insulated wire link rated >=3 A; change only with power off.\nNeither speaker terminal is ground. Without cap or link, output is open.\nNominal 4 ohm pole ~847 Hz; actual response follows tweeter impedance.\nAccount for capacitor phase/response in the DSP crossover.\nHeatsink and C21 fit checked by user (23 Oct 2026); bench thermal test remains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20c5d0de-27eb-4bb1-bce5-69d6a3653bff")
	)
	(text "ONBOARD TWEETER CAPACITOR / JP1 STEREO BYPASS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5110f016-7a3b-4bf0-ba38-28f2b3f8d522")
	)
	(text "SAFE STARTUP / FAULT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f3c6889-e01e-48c1-8bf4-6204492f064a")
	)
	(text "WOOFER / J16: DAC RIGHT -> AMPLIFIER RIGHT BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7ed2b222-041d-4582-8475-912af6385820")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT RC: C32/C54/C59/C60 = 10n C0G / 50V, FITTED.\nR6/R20/R34/R40 = 3R3 / 0.5W pulse-proof, FITTED.\nPost-filter branches to GND; check resistor heating on bench.\nRoute source-side input reference returns to the DAC GND.\nPower loops must not share those return traces."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7fd764e0-4517-4ef2-895e-d4beb89671d1")
	)
	(text "SDZ default LOW; MUTE default HIGH. 10k/100n command filtering\nlimits slew below TI 10 V/ms. SDZ asserted low is the primary safe state.\nMUTE command HIGH=mute, LOW=play. Wait >=50 ms after SDZ high\nbefore unmuting. FAULTZ open-drain -> GPIO35, 100k pull-up.\nNo automatic retry link: log fault, mute, cycle SDZ only after diagnosis."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "846f7769-5fb7-4885-b4a5-d0c6b703b099")
	)
	(text "TPA3126D2 - STEREO BTL / 4 OHM LOADS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca3ce5ca-48bd-4232-95db-3eeab68a11bd")
	)
	(text "15 W / CHANNEL TARGET AT 16 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb240ddc-4d03-4c2b-9b0e-839946d9d3d3")
	)
	(text "TWEETER / J17: DAC LEFT -> AMPLIFIER LEFT BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccfb7fc2-4043-4acd-9373-efb3a9f5ac46")
	)
	(text "20 dB MASTER; AM[2:0]=000 -> 400 kHz nominal. MODSEL=0 -> hybrid mode.\nEach CSAD package: winding 1-2, winding 4-3. No assumed flux cancellation.\nTI Fig.31 filter: 10u per leg + 680n to GND per leg (four film capacitors total).\nATS-TI1OP-521-C1-R1 over U1; fit checked by user. Top PowerPAD, no PCB EP copper.\nTop pad may be grounded (preferred) or floating per TI; never connect it to PVDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e04d687e-88b1-4459-b6f7-7e1a52793e97")
	)
	(text "PLIMIT: 3V3-ESP -> R19 10k / C29 1u RC; no lower divider resistor.\nTI peak-rail model ~19W unclipped / 4 ohm nominal.\nHeadroom for 15W; not an exact 15W protection limit.\nInput pad 1k2 / 1k5 plus DAC 470R -> 0.466 gain.\n15W / 4 ohm = 7.75Vrms: calibrate DSP per channel.\nPower derates below 16V; measure clipping / thermals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 207.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e9958a0f-cfde-407b-b065-7b20b73e674f")
	)
